  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Freundlich&nbsp;adsorption Isotherm,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></math><br />from the graph,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>.",
